abstract: >-
  Derived linguistic datasets over ancient-language corpora —
  form-to-lemma tables, segmentation layers, script-neutralization
  rules — grouped by language, published as CSV with Frictionless
  Data Package v2 manifests carrying full derivation provenance.
  Produced by Nabu (https://github.com/arvicco/nabu).
